  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Chi Shan explains the stack on Qing Mao Mountain: Xiong Li already has one bear’s strength from Brown Bear Innate Strength Gu, and Grand Bear Gu can raise that by another bear, for two bears’ strength in total.",
        "chapters": [
          123
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_chi_shan",
          "gu_brown_bear_innate_strength_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Xiong Li activates it, his hair stiffens like steel needles, his muscles enlarge, and he grows taller and bulkier, reaching the strength of two bears. He can later release that supporting strength.",
        "chapters": [
          126
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In a later fight against Bai Ning Bing he again uses Grand Bear Gu at two bears’ strength, and his fists smash through a water barrier.",
        "chapters": [
          135
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_ning_bing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Besides the strength contests around the three-clan alliance, Xiong Li relies on Grand Bear Gu in the Qing Shu vine contest and in the wolf-tide clash with Bai Ning Bing noted above.",
        "chapters": [
          126
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "xiong-lis-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_qing_shu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
